The goal:

1. react (typescript) frontend
2. rails (api-only) backend

Features:
- users exist
- admins exist
- admins can add master records from discogs api
- all users can rate master records
  - rating happens relatively, not by entering a statistic
	- numerical ratings are generated based on relative ranking, within 3 buckets (good/bad/meh)

Data model:
- users
- master records
- ratings